Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Type "d"
Sleep 2.5s
Up
Sleep 1s
Up
Sleep 1s
Up
Sleep 2.5s
Type "d"
Sleep 800ms
Type "t"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "t"
Sleep 1s
Type "t"
Sleep 1s
Hide
Type "q"
